      "blocks": {
        "text_iFjgpq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>3. Our Design Approach</h4><h2></h2><p>At Simran Design, we believe that every commercial space should do more than just look good. It should:</p><p>༶ <strong>Tell a story</strong> about the brand</p><p>༶ <strong>Elevate functionality</strong> for all users</p><p>༶ <strong>Evoke emotion</strong> and memorability</p><p>Our aesthetic leans toward modern luxury - mixing warm textures, clever layouts, refined details, and timeless colour palettes. Each project is bespoke, whether we’re transforming a café into a day-to-night destination or refining a boardroom for high-level meetings.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
